@host = https://localhost:7040

### Connectivity + language negotiation (anonymous)
GET {{host}}/api/v1/system/status
Accept: application/json
Accept-Language: mr

### Liveness
GET {{host}}/health/live

### Readiness (PostgreSQL)
GET {{host}}/health/ready

### OpenAPI document (Development only) — import into Postman
GET {{host}}/openapi/v1.json
